%% 共享模式轮询；Float32解码不重采样
class WasapiCapture {
  -CaptureSource m_source
  -QMutex m_mutex
  -QList_AudioPacket m_packets
  -float m_level
  -qint64 m_lastPacketTime
  +WasapiCapture(parent)
  +~WasapiCapture()
  +devices(loopback) QList_CaptureSource$
  +decode(data, frames, format, flags, timestamp) AudioPacket$
  +begin(source) bool
  +stop() void
  +takePackets() QList_AudioPacket
  +level() float
  +opened() signal
  +failed(message) signal
  #run() void
}
QThread <|-- WasapiCapture
WasapiCapture --> IAudioClient : 共享设备格式
WasapiCapture --> IAudioCaptureClient : 麦克风 / 回环
WasapiCapture *-- AudioPacket : 最多50包
